<section class="grid"><span class="label">More</span><div class="copy"><p>A shorter chronology, including the move to Scotland, is on the <a href="/timeline">timeline</a>.</p></div></section>

<section class="grid"><span class="label">Contact</span><div class="notice">Reach me through <a href="/contact">the contact page</a> or on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/javierponz" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>. Source code for everything above is at <a href="https://github.com/ponzgpt" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">github.com/ponzgpt</a>.</div></section>
